{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00890","headline":"鼓吹曲辞 雉子班 · 李白","name":"鼓吹曲辞 雉子班","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"辟邪伎作鼓吹惊，雉子班之奏曲成。\n喔咿振迅欲飞鸣，扇锦翼，雄风生。\n双雌同饮啄，趫悍谁能争。\n乍向草中耿介死，不求黄金笼下生。\n天地至广大，何惜遂物情。\n善卷让天子，务光亦逃名。\n所贵旷士怀，朗然合太清。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00890.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00890","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}